<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Snyder begun as strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Snyder begun as strong buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it started coverage of Snyder Communications Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 30-2/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
